  "prefLabel": "Gen 103.03 Board Meetings and Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 103.03 Board Meetings and Quorum.\n\n(a) The board meets quarterly or more often as its business requires.\n\n(b) A quorum required for meetings shall be a majority of the members of the board who have been approved by the governor and council.\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #13554, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 103.05); ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26 (formerly Gen 103.04)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen100.html"
